            "check:test:client"
          ],
          "followups": []
        },
        {
          "id": "MODEL-02.3",
          "summary": "Radicals (singlet, doublet, triplet, unknown), query atoms (any, any but hydrogen, heteroatom, halogen, or a list of 1 to 10 elements, optionally negated), query bonds (any, or a list of single, double, triple and aromatic), aromatic, dative and unknown bonds, and attachment points 1 to 4 are recorded, refused in invalid combinations with a stable reason, saved, reopened and undone. Representation only: no query is matched and no aromaticity is perceived.",
          "status": "implemented",
          "implementation": [
            "crates/domain/src/states.rs",
            "crates/domain/src/document.rs",
            "crates/application/src/contract.rs",
